{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"03875e61d8249c9e454302566f4e96ba70471f80063e01949a756cb0b8716538","ja":"今日の公演、うまくできたかな……？\n……今日もあの人に会いに行かなきゃ♪","zh":"今天的公演，顺利完成了吗……？\n……今天也得去见那个人才行♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3475c17cc374199c432c6601cdcbc8d0c5c9f2aae48995992f592aa070bfac67","ja":"あ、雪歩。……この後の打ち上げの話をしようと\n思ったのに、行っちゃったね……。","zh":"啊，雪步。……本来想和她说说之后庆功宴的事，结果她已经走了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"89032c61611fe8183c1eb43e106ad8e332fb4c1eb5d72fd9710311b68b927a00","ja":"急いでたみたいね。公演が終わったばかりなのに、\nあわててなんの用事かしら？","zh":"好像很着急呢。明明公演才刚结束，\n这么慌慌张张的是有什么事吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"aa1a243a1b5a920c828ae0b164dd11cccdfa9028bd37e0134ab69fcabeed5689","ja":"最近多いんだ、雪歩。公演の後すぐにどこか行っ\nちゃってさ。誰かと会ってるみたいなんだけど……。","zh":"最近雪步总是这样。演出结束后就马上跑去什么地方了。好像是在和谁见面……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"66ac65e199342d61aff331a0a2c6d141a6a2ec0a7359404fb5b2b53474a4b926","ja":"なんだか嬉しそうだったの。\n……ファンの人と密会だったり？","zh":"总觉得她好像很开心。\n……难道是和粉丝私下见面？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"93fc9d8747542bf007cd9e8898a29ad297b0432907a5530c9cf5c0c46a5adf76","ja":"まさか！　男の人と話すのが苦手な雪歩だよ？\nありえないと思うけどなぁ……。","zh":"不会吧！雪步可是很不擅长和男性说话的哦？\n我觉得不可能吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2ff44d9dd0cb8b7000c0a6d16a03a1070323dcf876878fafb62795df3d0eecb5","ja":"あら、相手は男性とは限らないんじゃない？\n雪歩のファン層も拡がってるみたいだし……。","zh":"哎呀，对方也不一定是男性吧？听说雪步的粉丝群体似乎也在扩大……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8bbc3bab70df2d34ec5883d8c7e858d6686fa543be829b811fac03453ef3c945","ja":"そうだね。『Xs』には女性ファンも多いって、\n●●●●プロデューサーも言ってたの。","zh":"是啊，●●●●制作人也说过，《Xs》的女性粉丝很多。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"01152e1a66266bc762b460ce922bb014324181b4eb2340319883c74723d34fcf","ja":"うう、そんなこと言われると、なんだか\n心配になってきたな……よし、確認してみよう！","zh":"呜，被你这么一说，总觉得有点担心起来了……好，确认一下吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
